WEBVTT

00:00:56.116 --> 00:01:02.476
are a lush, vast, expanse of weeds, shrubs

00:01:02.516 --> 00:01:06.836
and trees that absorb carbon

00:01:06.836 --> 00:01:08.316
from the atmosphere.

00:01:08.756 --> 00:01:13.316
They span 145,000 kilometers.

00:01:13.996 --> 00:01:18.996
The peat formations
began 10,000 years ago,

00:01:18.996 --> 00:01:23.596
when man moved from
hunter-gatherer to farmer.

00:01:24.556 --> 00:01:27.836
Nature, I guess, figured,
"I better start protecting myself."